[phase] critic-plan
[usage]
[critique] wave 0 plan: revise
[directions] d-07 [open] Quantify BBN + relic-density allowed region in (m_s, sin^2 2; d-08 [open] Quantify X-ray radiative decay constraints (E_gamma=m_s/2, G; d-09 [open] Survey 2024-2026 arXiv production-mechanism literature (DW, ; d-10 [open] Audit server validity range and observational baselines for 
**Plan** — 4 lines of investigation:
1. Quantify BBN + relic-density allowed region in (m_s, sin^2 2theta) with sterile-nu tools and produce reproducible Yp/D/H and Delta N_eff numbers — Core quantitative deliverable: BBN Yp/D/H grid, Delta N_eff exclusion, and overclosure bound. Directly answers which mixings BBN leaves open vs what relic density requires, with tool provenance.
2. Quantify X-ray radiative decay constraints (E_gamma=m_s/2, Gamma, flux) vs 2024-2026 limits and combine with BBN to map viable DM regions — X-ray line nu_s->nu+gamma is the binding constraint for keV DM; must compute predicted rates/fluxes with tools and compare to published NuSTAR/INTEGRAL/SPI/Chandra/XRISM upper limits on sin^2 2theta(m_s)
3. Survey 2024-2026 arXiv production-mechanism literature (DW, Shi-Fuller resonant with lepton asymmetry, reheating/inflaton-decay) and structure-formation bounds — Viable (m_s, sin^2 2theta) depends on production mechanism (T_RH, m_phi, BR~1e-4, L) and Lyman-alpha/m_th limits; need literature-grounded per-mechanism viability map with provenance
4. Audit server validity range and observational baselines for reproducible BBN/X-ray interpretation — Prevents over-interpretation beyond tool limits and clarifies baseline offsets (brief Yp=0.245/D/H=2.5e-5 vs server Yp=0.2449/D/H=2.547e-5) needed for Delta chi2 and N_eff claims. (added by the critic)
Critic's view: revise — Exceeds 10-call budget: 1x describe +1x grid +3x scan (DW + SF L=0.01,0.1) +2x plot +1x SBL +3x predict +1x list =12+. Also 50x50 grid =2500 points exceeds predict_sterile_nu_grid max 400. Reduce to <=400 points (e.g., 20x20) and limit to 1-2 scans.; Duplicates d-08 predict_sterile_nu_grid usage. Consolidate grid generation in d-07 and reuse outputs in d-08. Specify artifact_dir and dispatch for reproducibility.; Missing explicit Delta N_eff BBN (~1 MeV) vs CMB (~0.3 eV) comparison and thermalization fraction check required by brief. Add to success criteria..
