y): 7.1/10/20 keV at 1e-10 BBN-allowed but X-ray-excluded; 40/50 keV at 1e-10 BBN-allowed but overclosing; at 1e-12 all BBN-allowed and not overclosing, X-ray status requires external 2024-2026 limits. No figures extracted.
