**Completed — Audit server validity range and observational baselines for reproducible BBN/X-ray interpretation.** Audit established server validity, baselines, and caps via describe_sterile_nu_tools (tc-261102_1-w1-d-10-19) and predict_sterile_nu spot checks. Validity: m_s < ~100 keV relativistic at BBN; BBN fit calibrated N_eff 2.044-6.044, omega_b h2 0.019-0.0257, tau_n 866.4-890.4 s; exclusion Delta chi2 vs SM >3.84 (95% 1 dof); MeV+ (tested 1 MeV sin2 1e-10 tc-261102_1-w1-d-10-72) flagged bbn_treatment_valid=false, decay injection not modeled, not constraints. Baselines: Yp=0.2449±0.004 Aver Olive Skillman JCAP 07 (2021) 029, D/H=2.547±0.025e-5 Cooke Pettini Steidel ApJ 855 (2018) 102, N_eff_CMB=2.99±0.17 Planck 2018 TT TE EE+lowE+lensing+BAO, N_eff_S4 forecast 3.044±0.03; SM at N_eff=3.044 gives Yp=0.24682 D/H=2.4433e-5 chi2=2.77 (tc-261102_1-w1-d-10-31). Brief vs server: Yp 0.245 vs 0.2449 delta 0.0001 (0.025 sigma), D/H 2.5e-5 vs 2.547e-5 delta 0.047e-5 (1.88 sigma); SM offset +0.48 sigma Yp, -4.15 sigma D/H. Caps: SF Delta N_eff heuristic 0.1x DW not resonant (7100 eV 7e-11 L=0.01 gives Delta N_eff 4.33e-05 Omega 1366 vs DW 0.000433 Omega 0.033 tc-261102_1-w1-d-10-71/34), L<=0.1, no xi_e, non-thermal reheating/BR~1e-4 not modeled, X-ray 10 NuSTAR/XMM limits 5 targets (Perseus M31 Milky_Way_center Coma stacked_galaxies), 3.5 keV line debated. BBN limit Delta N_eff<0.548 (95%) slopes dYp/dN_eff=0.01351 dD/H5/dN_eff=0.3308, thermalized sterile N_eff=4.044 Yp=0.25956 D/H=2.7769e-5 3.7 sigma high (tc-261102_1-w1-d-10-73). File: /Users/nramachandra/hep-genesis-testing/projects/ramp-research-sterile-bbn-xray/runs/261102_163543/bbn_vs_neff.png Figure 27. Tool-quantifiable: DW BBN/X-ray Delta N_eff Yp/D/H Omega_s h2 Gamma tau E_gamma=m_s/2; literature-only: SF resonant L>0.1, reheating T_RH/m_phi/BR, xi_e, MeV decay cascades, XRISM/Chandra time-dependent mixing/twin-sector/U(1)B-L evasion. One-page audit table content in findings f-024 to f-027 f-039 to f-041; markdown file not written due to tool budget - to be saved to runs/261102_163543/ for d-07/d-08/d-09 reuse.
