**Critic, wave 1** — continue: 5 findings stand up to the evidence, 14 questioned ('Sterile-nu server BBN baselines: Yp=0.2449±0.004 (Aver et al. JCAP 07 2021 029), D/H=2.547': Evidence tc-261102_1-w1-d-07-22 excerpt is generic help text with no Yp, D/H, N_eff, omega_b h2, tau_n, Delta chi2 or m_s validity numbers; does not support baselines claim.; 'Server BBN validity: m_s < ~100 keV (relativistic at BBN); BBN fit calibrated for N_eff 2.': Evidence tc-19 generic help plus tc-31 SM point and tc-33 thermalized point do not contain N_eff 2.044-6.044, omega_b h2 0.019-0.0257, tau_n 866.4-890.4, Delta chi2>3.84 or m_s<~100 keV validity ranges.; 'Server observational baselines: Yp=0.2449±0.004 (Aver, Olive & Skillman JCAP 07 (2021) 029': Evidence tc-19 generic and tc-31 SM point do not contain Yp=0.2449+/-0.004 Aver et al., D/H=2.547+/-0.025e-5 Cooke et al., N_eff_CMB=2.99+/-0.17 Planck or N_eff_S4 forecast; SM Yp/D/H numbers alone insufficient.; 'Brief vs server baseline offset: brief Yp=0.245 vs server 0.2449 (delta 0.0001, 0.025 sigm': Evidence does not contain brief Yp=0.245/D/H=2.5e-5 vs server 0.2449/2.547e-5 offsets, sigma calculations, or baseline-dependence discussion.).

Issues: 2024-2026 X-ray upper-limit table not completed: web_search DNS failed and tool budget exhausted before read_arxiv_chunk/cite/get_paper_figures. Only built-in Roach+2020/Dessert+2020 limits used, so quantitative margin vs XRISM Perseus, NuSTAR stray-light 2405.17861, INTEGRAL/SPI, Chandra/XMM archival sin2 limits and full DW Omega=0.12 exclusion remain open (dead end x-04).; Production-mechanism survey blocked after 10 web_search/describe calls: no bibliography with URLs, no verbatim quotes, no Viel+2005 m_th->m_s translation at 7.1/10/20/50 keV, no per-mechanism viability table, no BBN/X-ray tool cross-checks (dead end x-03).; BBN baseline offset brief Yp 0.245/D/H 2.5e-5 vs server 0.2449/2.547e-5 (1.88 sigma in D/H) not propagated to Delta N_eff<0.548 robustness; absolute chi2 shifts but Delta chi2 threshold claimed baseline-independent without demonstration across omega_b h2/tau_n ranges..
